<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAFRICA'S OLD MUTUAL APPOINTS GOSS DEPUTY CHAIRMAN.</title>
<headline>SAFRICA'S OLD MUTUAL APPOINTS GOSS DEPUTY CHAIRMAN.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African Mutual Life Assurance Society (Old Mutual) said Dick Goss had been appointed deputy chairman of Old Mutual, replacing Alistair Macmillan who is retiring at the end of June.</p>
<p>Goss is also deputy chairman of Nedcor Ltd and former chief executive officer of South African Breweries.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
